  "$comment": "Run O1 lane K1 batch b5: series data for Fullmetal Alchemist (tier B), one hub for the two TV anime, built from pinned Wikipedia revisions (manga article, 2003 TV series article, Brotherhood article, the two episode lists and the character list), Wikidata Q189562 (manga), Q711257 (2003 anime) and Q437808 (Brotherhood), and two official pages (the Gangan manga page and the Brotherhood artist page); facts are drafts for review. The allowed sources name no story arcs, so the two arcs are the two anime adaptations, 2003 anime (51 episodes) and Brotherhood (64 episodes, the full manga story); episode ranges therefore restart in each arc, and questions must say which anime they mean. Characters first seen in the 2003 anime are debut arc 1, those found only in Brotherhood and the manga debut in arc 2 (episode summaries of both episode lists were used; when unsure the later arc was chosen). The Wikipedia manga article gives 108 chapters but Wikidata lists 116 parts, so no chapter count is stored. Themes are the openings and endings of both TV series: 2003 anime as season 1 (OP 1 to 4, ED 1 to 4; episode 1 used Melissa as an ending), Brotherhood as season 2 (OP 5 to 9, ED 5 to 9; the finale episodes reuse earlier songs). King Bradley carries identity_spoiler because his true nature is a major reveal.",
